##-------------------------------------------------------------
## 2010 Ford Fusion SEL V6
## Replacement for Ford Mustang GT
## fe_attrib.bin patch script
##--------------------------------------------------------------

vpak GLOBAL\FE_ATTRIB.BIN frontend

##---------------------------------------------------
## Node: frontend/vehicles/north_america/ford/mustanggt
##---------------------------------------------------

## manufacturer
patch	dword	bin:0xbab8	2

## cost
patch	int32	bin:0xbac4	42000

## required_bl_level
patch	int8	bin:0xbad1	9